blurry-b 2026-11-26: coin_b/coin_n/coin_q/coin_r.png re-traced to clean vector shapes (palette-quantised, potrace, re-rendered as a 512px transparent PNG at ~90%, hard anti-aliased edges, no fading; tool rebuild/app/tools/sprite_vec.py) from the existing video crop, because no copy of the same image was found online (the blurred glow ring is now a solid ring).
blurry-b 2026-11-26: pawn, knight, rook, queen, joker, bot.png are the same Chess Survivors pixel sprites rebuilt from the blurred video crop: the art-pixel grid was measured, each cell sampled and palette-quantised, then scaled up nearest-neighbour to a 512px transparent PNG (rebuild/app/tools/sprite_repix.py). No copy of the game sprites was found online.
